"fn\">d</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float64.Diag\">Diag</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Mat.html#BLAS.Float64.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Vec.html#BLAS.Float64.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Vec.html#BLAS.Float64.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`trsv uplo d A x` solves `A * y = x` for the triangle `uplo` of `A`, with a unit diagonal if `d` is\n`.unit`, by the column-oriented loops of the reference BLAS. For the lower triangle, it solves for\n`y[j]` and subtracts `y[j]` times column `j` of `A` from the elements below it, for\n`j = 0, …, n - 1`; for the upper triangle, it does the same from `j = n - 1` down to `0`, for the\nelements above. It updates `x` in place when its array is not shared, and leaves the elements of\nthe array outside `x` unchanged. It reads only the triangle `uplo` of `A`, and not its diagonal\nwhen `d` is `.unit`. Like the reference BLAS, it doesn't check for a zero on the diagonal.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float64/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float64.Mat.trsv","kind":"def","line":397,"name":"BLAS.Float64.Mat.trsv","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float64/Trsv.lean#L397-L411"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float64.Mat.trsvData_eq\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float64</span>.<span class=\"name\">Mat</span>.<span class=\"name\">trsvData_eq</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float64.Uplo\">Uplo</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">d</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float64.Diag\">Diag</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Mat.html#BLAS.Float64.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Vec.html#BLAS.Float64.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float64.Mat.trsvData\">trsvData</a> <span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">x</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Vec.html#BLAS.Float64.Vec.data\">data</a></span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float64/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Float64Array.modifyAt\">modifyAt</a></span> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Vec.html#BLAS.Float64.Vec.stride\">stride</a></span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Stride.html#ScalarArray.Stride.idx\">idx</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">0</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">fun (<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>) (<span class=\"fn\">x_1</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float.html#Float\">Float</a>) =&gt; <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float64.Mat.trsvSol\">trsvSol</a> <span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <span class=\"fn\">i</span></span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./BLAS/Float64/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float64.Mat.trsvData_eq","kind":"theorem","line":391,"name":"BLAS.Float64.Mat.trsvData_eq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float64/Trsv.lean#L391-L395"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float64.Mat.trsvData\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float64</span>.<span class=\"name\">Mat</span>.<span class=\"name\">trsvData</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float64.Uplo\">Uplo</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">d</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float64.Diag\">Diag</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Mat.html#BLAS.Float64.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Vec.html#BLAS.Float64.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float64/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float64Array\">ScalarArray.Float64Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The array of `trsv`.","docLi